  <CENTER><H1>Patch Message</H1></CENTER>
<H2>January 10th</H2>
<BR>
<BR>
** Changes made with the Emergency Patch **<BR>
<BR>
- Fixed the bug where Rune spells and others (such as the buff icon when a familiar is used) where not being removed and where cancel magic wasn't appearing to cancel anything<BR>
- Clerics, wizards, and druids can buff their own pets/familiars again<BR>
- Fixed a bug that was allowing the Necromancer Group spells to stack<BR>
- Bards should now gain singing skill when singing and should no longer gain skill in an instrument when they are not using one<BR>
- The chance to critical with the use of all levels of the Alternate Advancement abilities Spell Casting Fury and Spell Casting Fury Mastery has been increased<BR>
- We've also added a few more messages to indicate when spells can't affect their targets, these mostly concern pets.<BR>
